	(text "Single-ended to differential ADC driver, the Timekeeper's AnalogInputBuffer: THS4522 channel A, gain 0.59 (620R / 1.05k), 40.2R + 2.7n differential filter, VOCM from VCOM_B.\nThe input reference (INN side) goes to VCOM_A, the DC level of the input buffer output (the Timekeeper left it open). Channel B is powered down [CONFIRM unused-channel handling in the THS4522 datasheet]."
